summary:
  The word pass asks the directory for "radio" when the listener typed "nova radio".

history:
  The directory answers a name with its 50 most voted matches. Asked for
  "radio" they ran from 825 222 votes down to 23 417 and one of them was a
  Radio Nova; asked for "nova", twenty-one were. The word asked for is the
  longest that is no station word; this lets the station words back in.

target:
  package/contents/ui/SearchLogic.js

find:
          if (parts[i].length >= 3 && !NAME_WORDS.hasOwnProperty(fold(parts[i]))) own.push(parts[i]);

replace:
          if (parts[i].length >= 3) own.push(parts[i]);

expect:
  Killed by tst_searchlogic::test_the_word_pass_asks_for_the_listeners_own_word.
  Line-neutral.
